   ],
   "line": "I met a Traveller from an antique land, / Who said, “Two vast and trunkless legs of stone / Stand in the desart. Near them, on the sand,"
  },
  {
   "id": "shattered-visage",
   "image": "02-shattered-visage.png",
   "lines": 5,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.7,
    "y": 0.55
   },
   "textPreset": "searchlight-scan",
   "transitionMs": 1000,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.46,
     "y": 0.06,
     "width": 0.48,
     "height": 0.17
    }
   ],
   "line": "Half sunk, a shattered visage lies, whose frown, / And wrinkled lip, and sneer of cold command, / Tell that its sculptor well those passions read, / Which yet survive, stamped on these lifeless things, / The hand that mocked them, and the heart that fed:"
  },
  {
   "id": "king-of-kings",
   "image": "03-king-of-kings.png",
   "lines": 3,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.3,
    "y": 0.25
   },
   "textPreset": "uniform-formation",
   "transitionMs": 1000,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.07,
     "width": 0.44,
     "height": 0.2
    }
   ],
   "line": "And on the pedestal these words appear: / “My name is Ozymandias, King of Kings.” / Look on my works ye Mighty, and despair!"
  },
  {
   "id": "lone-and-level-sands",
   "image": "04-lone-and-level-sands.png",
   "lines": 3,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.5,
    "y": 0.6
   },
   "textPreset": "farewell-drift",
   "transitionMs": 1300,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.08,
     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.84,
     "height": 0.24
    }
   ],
   "line": "No thing beside remains. Round the decay / Of that Colossal Wreck, boundless and bare, / The lone and level sands stretch far away."
  }
 ]
